iv>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"Example 14.1, pp. 382–383; scans 390–391"},{"key":"source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Example 14.1, pp. 382–383; scans 390–391"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1,2\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1,2\\}\\)</span> 为三个数值字符的字母表。栈机、各变体和语言见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cd94bc0acee32218\" href=\"?note=cd94bc0acee32218\" title=\"73-df-stack-automaton-variants\">73-df-stack-automaton-variants</a>；CFL 泵引理见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5c8c56808857d2df\" href=\"?note=5c8c56808857d2df\" title=\"73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound\">73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}one\\text{-}way\\text{-}nonerasing\\text{-}stack\\text{-}witness}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\;[\\operatorname{SA}_{\\Sigma}(A)\\land\\operatorname{DSA}(A)\\land\\operatorname{NESA}(A)\\land\\operatorname{OneWaySA}(A)\\land L(A)=\\{0^n1^n2^n:n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\}\\land L(A)\\notin\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}one\\text{-}way\\text{-}nonerasing\\text{-}stack\\text{-}witness}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\;[\\operatorname{SA}_{\\Sigma}(A)\\land\\operatorname{DSA}(A)\\land\\operatorname{NESA}(A)\\land\\operatorname{OneWaySA}(A)\\land L(A)=\\{0^n1^n2^n:n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\}\\land L(A)\\notin\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>读 0 时压入计数符号，读 1 时逐格深入只读栈，到底标记时切换阶段；读 2 时逐格回到栈顶，仅在随后读到右端标记时进入终态。有限控制拒绝空块及顺序错误。栈从不弹出；三个块相等由两次单向栈头行程保证。非 CFL 由标准三块泵反例得到。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-stack-automaton-variants","status":"resolved","id":"cd94bc0acee32218","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-stack-automaton-variants]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound","status":"resolved","id":"5c8c56808857d2df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-stack-automaton-variants","status":"resolved","id":"cd94bc0acee32218","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1,2\\}$ 为三个数值字符的字母表。栈机、各变体和语言见 [[73-df-stack-automaton-variants]]；CFL 泵引理见 [[73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound","status":"resolved","id":"5c8c56808857d2df","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1,2\\}$ 为三个数值字符的字母表。栈机、各变体和语言见 [[73-df-stack-automaton-variants]]；CFL 泵引理见 [[73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1,2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}one\\text{-}way\\text{-}nonerasing\\text{-}stack\\text{-}witness}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\;[\\operatorname{SA}_{\\Sigma}(A)\\land\\operatorname{DSA}(A)\\land\\operatorname{NESA}(A)\\land\\operatorname{OneWaySA}(A)\\land L(A)=\\{0^n1^n2^n:n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\}\\land L(A)\\notin\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}]","display":true}],"bytes":1992,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-354"